{"id":"9105ca0b5fd7f993","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion.md","title":"Friedberg跳跃反演","display":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg跳跃反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion","aliases":["43-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion"],"display":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg跳跃反演","depends_on":["[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.13.1, print pp.54–55 / PDF pp.74–75","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-friedberg-jump-inversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-jump-inversion — Friedberg跳跃反演"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.13.1, print pp.54–55 / PDF pp.74–75"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\prime\\le_TD\">\\(\\varnothing\\prime\\le_TD\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\prime\\le_TD\\Rightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (A\\prime\\equiv_TD\\land A\\oplus\\varnothing\\prime\\equiv_TD).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\prime\\le_TD\\Rightarrow\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (A\\prime\\equiv_TD\\land A\\oplus\\varnothing\\prime\\equiv_TD).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限扩展构造交替决定跳跃位并编码D；D≥T∅′使得构造可从D进行。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.13.1, print pp.54–55 / PDF pp.74–75。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":